// P4_16 (v1model) definition for: Bmv BmvMarketData Product13 Intra v1.1
// 
// Protocol:
//   Organization: Bolsa Mexicana de Valores
//   Protocol: Bmv Market Data Product 13
//   Encoding: INTRA Multicast
//   Version: 1.1
//   Date: Unknown
//   Specification: Market Data Multicast_P13_1_ENG.pdf
// 
// Byte order: big (P4 extracts in network/big-endian order)
// 
// Script:
//   Generator: 1.0.0.0
